SUMMARY:Fall Bulb Sale
DESCRIPTION:Plant now. Enjoy next spring.\n\n\n\nGet a head start on next year’s garden with our Fall Bulb Sale\, happening September 7 through 20. Choose from a beautiful selection of tulips\, hyacinths\, crocuses\, daffodils and more\, adding spring colour\, fragrance and food for pollinators to your garden. \n\n\n\nMembers save 20%\n\n\n\nTBG members get DOUBLE the usual member discount on bulbs. Save 20% on your bulb purchases through September 20. \n\n\n\nNot a member? Become a TBG member and enjoy this special offer\, along with year-round benefits at the Garden. \n\n\n\nWhy plant bulbs in fall?\n\n\n\nFall is the perfect time to plant spring-flowering bulbs. Tucked into the soil before winter\, bulbs spend the colder months establishing roots so they’re ready to burst into bloom when spring returns. \n\n\n\nCome early for the best selection. Most bulbs will be available beginning Labour Day\, with additional varieties arriving throughout the following week. \n\n\n\nFall Bulb Sale: September 7 through 20\, 2026Garden Shop from 10:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/fall-bulb-sale/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/New-Website-Header-2021-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
