SUMMARY:Milne House Club Annual Flower Show
DESCRIPTION:Milne House Garden Club Annual Flower Show“Celebrating Autumn” \nThursday September 17\, 1 to 4 p.m.Free Admission \nEvery year\, Milne House Garden Club holds a major flower show featuring garden specimens\, houseplants and floral designs that interpret specific themes. This year’s theme is ‘Celebrating Autumn’ with designs interpreting autumnal categories such as Harvest Thanksgiving\, Into the Forest\, Fall Fair\, Gourds\, Pumpkin\, Wildflowers\, Seedheads and In a Nutshell. \nTo learn more about the club\, visit https://milnehousegardenclub.ca
