SUMMARY:TBG Fall Ravine Festival
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a day of music\, adventure\, and education. Join us for the Ravine Festival\, an exciting day of fun and learning set against the beautiful backdrop of the Toronto Botanical Garden and its surrounding natural spaces. Discover fascinating facts about ravines\, local wildlife\, and how you can contribute to the preservation of Toronto’s ravine systems. This is a fantastic opportunity for families to get hands-on with nature and environmental stewardship. \n\n\n\nSaturday\, October 3\, 202612 to 4 p.m.FREE Admission \n\n\n\nGenerously supported by Enbridge \n\n\n\nEvent Highlights:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n12 to 4 p.m. Pick up your nature passport at the Visitor Centre to embark on a Scavenger Hunt across the Toronto Botanical Garden\, Wilket Creek Ravine and Teaching Garden in Edwards Gardens. Complete a series of activities to claim your special prize! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n10:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.Immerse yourself in Essense of the Garden: Plein Air Art Exhibition + Sale\, featuring over 100 original artworks from 46 talented local artists. The exhibition opens October 3 and runs until October 18. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLive music performances and Free Yoga sessions. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCircus at the Garden with Artists’ Play Dance + Circus Arts. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n10 a.m. to 4 p.m. Local eats at the Dandelion Cafe with light bites\, hot and cold beverages and Kawartha Dairy ice cream. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n10:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.Visit the Garden Shop for garden gear\, nature-inspired gifts\, and home decor. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMany Thanks to our Ravine Festival Community Partners:\n\n\n\nToronto Public Library\, Toronto and Region Conservation Authority\, SciXchange\, Human Nature Project\, Alan Li Artist\, North York Harvest\, Toronto Wildlife Centre and LiveGreen
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/tbg-fall-ravine-festival/
CATEGORIES:Family Programs,Ravines
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Ravine-Fall-Festival-2025.jpg
END:VEVENT
